        "description": "Distal sensory loss and diminished proprioception",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive distal muscle weakness with electrophysiological evidence of axonal neuropathy plus pathogenic HSPB1 gene mutation",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential for definitive diagnosis; clinical features overlap with other CMT subtypes."
